Dataset license: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
License text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The bundled dataset/digits.csv.gz file is copied unchanged from scikit-learn
1.9.1. Its source URL and SHA-256 are in dataset/provenance.json. The experiment
normalizes feature values by dividing pixels by 16 and creates seeded random
partitions; the cached source file remains unchanged.

