Concept reference
-----------------
Jinuk Kim and coauthors, GuidedQuant: Large Language Model Quantization via
Exploiting End Loss Guidance, ICML 2025.
https://proceedings.mlr.press/v267/kim25d.html

TinyQuant Lab implements its own NumPy classifier, clipping search, bit packing
and measurements. This repository includes no GuidedQuant implementation code.
